0.7499999999999999pt solid #c8a951;border-bottom:0.7499999999999999pt solid #c8a951;"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:12.000000000000002pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'times new roman';font-size:11pt;color:#1a1a2e;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#1a1a2e">158.400.000 VNĐ</span></p></td></tr></table><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;border:none;border-left:none;border-top:none;border-right:none;border-bottom:none;mso-border-between:none">&nbsp;</p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-top-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-right-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000"> </span></p><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:14pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;border-left:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-top:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-right:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-bottom:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'times new roman';font-size:12pt;color:#2c2c54;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#2c2c54"><b>III. Điều Khoản Chung</b></span></p><ul style="padding-left:36pt"><li style="list-style-type: disc"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-top-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-right-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'times new roman';font-size:12pt;color:#1a1a2e;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#1a1a2e">Thanh toán tiền cọc trước khi ký hợp đồng. Tiền cọc không được hoàn trả nếu Bên B hủy.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-type: disc"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-top-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-right-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'times new roman';font-size:12pt;color:#1a1a2e;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#1a1a2e">Thanh toán số dư còn lại trước ngày tổ chức ít nhất </span><span style="font-family:'times new roman';font-size:12pt;color:#1a1a2e;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#1a1a2e"><b>03 ngày làm việc</b></span><span style="font-family:'times new roman';font-size:12pt;color:#1a1a2e;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#1a1a2e">.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-type: disc"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-top-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-right-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-bottom-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'times new roman';font-size:12pt;color:#1a1a2e;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#1a1a2e">Mọi thay đổi số bàn, thực đơn phải thông báo trước ít nhất </span><span style="font-family:'times new roman';font-size:12pt;color:#1a1a2e;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#1a1a2e"><b>07 ngày</b></span><span style="font-family:'times new roman';font-size:12pt;color:#1a1a2e;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#1a1a2e">.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-type: disc"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;border:none;border-left:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-top:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-right:0.25pt solid #ffffff;border-bottom:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'times new roman';font-size:12pt;color:#1a1a2e;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#1a1a2e">Hợp đồng có hiệu lực kể từ khi cả hai bên ký tên và đóng dấu.</span></p></li></ul><p style="text-align:center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:0.25pt solid #ffffff;mso-border-t